<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first round,</p>
<p>first leg matches in African club soccer competitions on Friday:</p>
<p>Champions' Cup</p>
<p>In Cario: Zamalek (Egypt) 2 St George (Ethiopia) 0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Mohamed Sabri 75, Ahmed el-Kass 85</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup</p>
<p>In Kampala: Kampala City Council (Uganda) 3 Rwanda FC (Rwanda) 0 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Jackson Mayanja 56, 58, Haruna Mawa 71</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
